{
  "name": "Saul el Constructor - PUBLICADOR V11 (Blindado con Google Sheets)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "v11-note",
      "name": "🏗️ VERSION 11 - BLINDAJE TOTAL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [100, 50],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🛡️ V11 — BLINDAJE GOOGLE SHEETS\n\n1. **REGISTRO:** Al llenar la web, el número se guarda en Sheets.\n2. **FILTRO:** El robot solo responde si el número está en la lista.\n3. **PAZ TOTAL:** Tus amigos, familiares y grupos serán ignorados por la IA.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sheets-save-001",
      "name": "Guardar en Lista Blanca",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1000, 500],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetId": "TU_ID_DE_HOJA_AQUI",
        "range": "A:A",
        "options": {},
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Telefono": "={{ $json.body.telefono }}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sheets-check-001",
      "name": "Buscar en Lista Blanca",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1100, 100],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "lookup",
        "sheetId": "TU_ID_DE_HOJA_AQUI",
        "lookupColumn": "Telefono",
        "lookupValue": "={{ $node[\"Webhook Z-API Recepción\"].json.body.phone }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "if-whitelist-001",
      "name": "Está en la lista?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1400, 100],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.Telefono }}",
              "operation": "notEmpty"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Está en la lista?": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "AI Agent", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
